# Resolve the Quarkus application model sequentially. In parallel, the
# platform variants of an artifact (e.g. the protoc executables) wait on the
# same local repository lock, which Maven 3.9 does not split by classifier,
# and a slow first download makes the waiting threads time out.
-Dquarkus.bootstrap.blocking-task-runner=true
